KONOHA CRUSH — INCIDENT REPORT (COMPLETED)
Konohagakure Security Records

Event: A coordinated surprise assault on the village during the final
stage of the Chunin Exams, jointly launched by Otogakure (Sound) and its
temporary ally Sunagakure (Sand).

Course of Events:
- The attack was orchestrated by Orochimaru, who had infiltrated the exam
  disguised and manipulated the Fourth Kazekage into alliance (the
  Kazekage was, in fact, already dead and impersonated).
- Orochimaru engaged the Third Hokage, Hiruzen Sarutobi, in single combat
  and employed the Impure World Reincarnation to summon prior Hokage.
- The Third Hokage sealed away the reincarnated First and Second Hokage
  and crippled Orochimaru's arms with the Reaper Death Seal, dying in the
  effort.

Aftermath: The invasion was repelled at heavy cost, including the loss of
the Third Hokage. Sunagakure subsequently sued for peace and renewed its
alliance with Konoha. Tsunade was later installed as Fifth Hokage. Filed
for the record.
